<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Iniciativa: Referentes de Métricas - Publicaciones Mature</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/reveal.js@5.2.1/dist/reveal.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/reveal.js@5.2.1/dist/theme/black.css" id="theme">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --meli-yellow: #FFE600;
            --meli-blue: #3483FA;
            --meli-dark: #1A1A2E;
            --meli-darker: #0F0F1A;
            --accent-green: #00E676;
            --accent-red: #FF5252;
            --accent-orange: #FFAB40;
            --accent-purple: #B388FF;
            --accent-cyan: #18FFFF;
            --text-light: #E8E8F0;
            --text-muted: #A0A0B8;
        }

        .reveal {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        .reveal .slides {
            text-align: left;
        }

        .reveal .slides section {
            padding: 30px 50px;
        }

        /* ====== SLIDE 1: PORTADA ====== */
        .slide-cover {
            display: flex !important;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center !important;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(52, 131, 250, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),
                        radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%, rgba(255, 230, 0, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        var(--meli-darker);
        }

        .slide-cover .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--meli-blue), #6C63FF);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.55em;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .slide-cover h1 {
            font-size: 2.2em !important;
            font-weight: 900 !important;
            line-height: 1.15 !important;
            margin-bottom: 10px !important;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, var(--meli-yellow) 50%, var(--accent-cyan) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .slide-cover .subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .cover-metrics {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .cover-metrics .metric-pill {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 0.5em;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-weight: 500;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .cover-footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 0.45em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* ====== HEADERS GENERALES ====== */
        .slide-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .slide-header .icon {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .slide-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.5em !important;
            font-weight: 800 !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
            color: white !important;
        }

        .slide-header .tag {
            font-size: 0.4em;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ====== CARDS GRID ====== */
        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .cards-grid.cols-2 {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .cards-grid.cols-3 {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(52, 131, 250, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .card .card-icon {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 0.7em !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
            color: white !important;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0 !important;
        }

        .card p, .card li {
            font-size: 0.5em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
            line-height: 1.6 !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }

        .card ul {
            padding-left: 15px !important;
            margin: 5px 0 0 0 !important;
        }

        .card .highlight {
            color: var(--meli-yellow) !important;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .card .highlight-blue {
            color: var(--meli-blue) !important;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .card .highlight-green {
            color: var(--accent-green) !important;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* ====== STAT CARDS ====== */
        .stat-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .stat-card .stat-number {
            font-size: 2em;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-card .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.5em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* ====== TIMELINE ====== */
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 8px;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--meli-blue), var(--meli-yellow), var(--accent-green));
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: -26px;
            top: 5px;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--meli-blue);
            border: 2px solid var(--meli-darker);
        }

        .timeline-item h4 {
            font-size: 0.65em !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
            color: white !important;
            margin: 0 0 5px 0 !important;
        }

        .timeline-item p {
            font-size: 0.48em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
            line-height: 1.5 !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }

        /* ====== METRIC SECTION ====== */
        .metric-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid;
        }

        .metric-header .metric-emoji {
            font-size: 1.8em;
        }

        .metric-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.3em !important;
            font-weight: 800 !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }

        .metric-header .metric-desc {
            font-size: 0.5em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        /* ====== TABLE STYLES ====== */
        .styled-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.48em;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .styled-table th {
            background: rgba(52, 131, 250, 0.15);
            color: var(--meli-blue);
            padding: 10px 15px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(52, 131, 250, 0.3);
        }

        .styled-table td {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .styled-table tr:hover td {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        /* ====== PROCESO VISUAL ====== */
        .process-flow {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .process-step {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            text-align: center;
            min-width: 120px;
        }

        .process-step .step-num {
            font-size: 0.45em;
            color: var(--meli-blue);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .process-step .step-text {
            font-size: 0.5em;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .process-arrow {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: var(--meli-yellow);
        }

        /* ====== BENEFIT BAR ====== */
        .benefit-bar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-green);
        }

        .benefit-bar .benefit-icon {
            font-size: 1em;
        }

        .benefit-bar .benefit-text {
            font-size: 0.52em;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ====== QUOTE ====== */
        .big-quote {
            text-align: center !important;
            padding: 40px !important;
        }

        .big-quote blockquote {
            border: none;
            background: none;
            box-shadow: none;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .big-quote blockquote span {
            color: var(--meli-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* ====== ROLES VISUAL ====== */
        .role-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .role-card .role-badge {
            min-width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.55em;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: white;
        }

        .role-card h4 {
            font-size: 0.65em !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
            color: white !important;
            margin: 0 0 5px 0 !important;
        }

        .role-card p {
            font-size: 0.48em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
            line-height: 1.5 !important;
        }

        /* ====== INSIGHT BOX ====== */
        .insight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 230, 0, 0.08), rgba(52, 131, 250, 0.08));
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 230, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .insight-box .insight-label {
            font-size: 0.45em;
            color: var(--meli-yellow);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .insight-box p {
            font-size: 0.52em !important;
            color: var(--text-light) !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
            line-height: 1.6 !important;
        }

        /* ====== CIERRE ====== */
        .slide-closing {
            text-align: center !important;
            display: flex !important;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .slide-closing h2 {
            font-size: 2em !important;
            font-weight: 900 !important;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--meli-yellow), var(--accent-cyan));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .closing-pillars {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .closing-pillar {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .closing-pillar .pillar-icon {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .closing-pillar h4 {
            font-size: 0.6em !important;
            color: white !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }

        .closing-pillar p {
            font-size: 0.45em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
            margin-top: 5px !important;
        }

        /* Fragments custom */
        .reveal .slides section .fragment.fade-up {
            transform: translateY(20px);
        }

        /* Color accents para metric headers */
        .border-blue { border-left-color: var(--meli-blue) !important; }
        .border-yellow { border-left-color: var(--meli-yellow) !important; }
        .border-green { border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important; }
        .border-purple { border-left-color: var(--accent-purple) !important; }
        .border-cyan { border-left-color: var(--accent-cyan) !important; }
        .border-orange { border-left-color: var(--accent-orange) !important; }

        .text-yellow { color: var(--meli-yellow) !important; }
        .text-blue { color: var(--meli-blue) !important; }
        .text-green { color: var(--accent-green) !important; }
        .text-red { color: var(--accent-red) !important; }
        .text-purple { color: var(--accent-purple) !important; }
        .text-cyan { color: var(--accent-cyan) !important; }

        .bg-blue { background: var(--meli-blue) !important; }
        .bg-yellow { background: var(--meli-yellow) !important; color: #1A1A2E !important; }
        .bg-green { background: var(--accent-green) !important; color: #1A1A2E !important; }
        .bg-purple { background: var(--accent-purple) !important; }
        .bg-cyan { background: var(--accent-cyan) !important; color: #1A1A2E !important; }
        .bg-orange { background: var(--accent-orange) !important; color: #1A1A2E !important; }

        .small-text {
            font-size: 0.48em !important;
            color: var(--text-muted) !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="reveal">
        <div class="slides">

            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <!-- SLIDE 1: PORTADA -->
            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <section class="slide-cover" data-background-color="#0F0F1A">
                <div class="badge">📋 Propuesta Estratégica 2025</div>
                <h1>Referentes de Métricas<br>Publicaciones Mature</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Programa de liderazgo distribuido para estandarizar seguimientos, potenciar resultados y desarrollar futuros líderes en cada equipo.</p>
                <div class="cover-metrics">
                    <div class="metric-pill">⚡ Productividad</div>
                    <div class="metric-pill">⭐ NPS</div>
                    <div class="metric-pill">🎯 Adhesión Estilo Meli</div>
                    <div class="metric-pill">🔄 TDI</div>
                    <div class="metric-pill">🤖 QI</div>
                </div>
                <div class="cover-footer">Publicaciones Mature · 7 Equipos · Canal de Atención</div>
            </section>

            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <!-- SLIDE 2: CONTEXTO Y PROBLEMA -->
            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <section data-background-color="#0F0F1A" data-auto-animate>
                <div class="slide-header">
                    <div class="icon bg-blue">🔍</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Contexto Actual</h2>
                        <span class="tag">¿Dónde estamos hoy?</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid cols-2">
                    <div class="card" data-fragment-index="1" class="fragment fade-up">
                        <div class="card-icon">🚧</div>
                        <h3>Referentes sin apropiación</h3>
                        <p>Existen referentes asignados a cada métrica, pero <span class="highlight">no se percibe apropiación del rol</span>. La rotación cada 3 meses impide generar continuidad y profundidad en los planes de acción.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card" data-fragment-index="2" class="fragment fade-up">
                        <div class="card-icon">📊</div>
                        <h3>Falta de diferencial por equipo</h3>
                        <p>No hay un trabajo diferenciado que permita que <span class="highlight-blue">cada equipo mejore en cada métrica</span> con planes específicos, seguimientos estructurados y análisis profundos.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card" data-fragment-index="3" class="fragment fade-up">
                        <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
                        <h3>Métricas sin cumplimiento sostenido</h3>
                        <p>Varias métricas no se cumplen de forma consistente. Se evidencia <span class="highlight">alta dispersión</span> entre representantes y entre equipos sin un mecanismo de cierre de brechas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card" data-fragment-index="4" class="fragment fade-up">
                        <div class="card-icon">🧩</div>
                        <h3>Oportunidad de desarrollo</h3>
                        <p>No se aprovecha el potencial de los referentes como <span class="highlight-green">semillero de liderazgo</span>: presentaciones, análisis de datos, seguimiento y toma de decisiones.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <!-- SLIDE 3: PROPUESTA - VISIÓN GENERAL -->
            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <section data-background-color="#0F0F1A" data-auto-animate>
                <div class="slide-header">
                    <div class="icon bg-yellow">💡</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>La Propuesta</h2>
                        <span class="tag">Visión General</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 0.6em; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.7;">
                    Crear un <strong style="color: var(--meli-yellow);">programa de Referentes de Métricas</strong> con estructura, continuidad y peso en el COMO de cada representante. Por cada equipo (7 en total) se designan <strong style="color: var(--meli-blue);">2 a 3 referentes por métrica</strong>: un líder principal y un secundario, con reuniones quincenales/mensuales para construir planes de trabajo, muestreos y seguimientos.
                </p>

                <div class="process-flow fragment fade-up">
                    <div class="process-step">
                        <div class="step-num">PASO 1</div>
                        <div class="step-text">Selección<br>Referentes</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-arrow">→</div>
                    <div class="process-step">
                        <div class="step-num">PASO 2</div>
                        <div class="step-text">Asignación<br>de Roles</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-arrow">→</div>
                    <div class="process-step">
                        <div class="step-num">PASO 3</div>
                        <div class="step-text">Planes de<br>Trabajo</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-arrow">→</div>
                    <div class="process-step">
                        <div class="step-num">PASO 4</div>
                        <div class="step-text">Seguimiento<br>Quincenal</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-arrow">→</div>
                    <div class="process-step">
                        <div class="step-num">PASO 5</div>
                        <div class="step-text">Resultados<br>& Insights</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="insight-box fragment fade-up">
                    <div class="insight-label">🎯 Objetivo Central</div>
                    <p>Estandarizar planes de acción, seguimientos, muestreos y análisis a nivel de <strong style="color: white;">todo Publicaciones Mature</strong>, para que los referentes se apropien de su rol, lideren resultados y se construyan como futuros líderes.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <!-- SLIDE 4: ESTRUCTURA DE REFERENTES -->
            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <section data-background-color="#0F0F1A" data-auto-animate>
                <div class="slide-header">
                    <div class="icon bg-purple">👥</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Estructura de Referentes</h2>
                        <span class="tag">7 Equipos × 5 Métricas</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid cols-2" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div>
                        <div class="role-card fragment fade-up">
                            <div class="role-badge bg-blue">L1</div>
                            <div>
                                <h4>Referente Líder (Principal)</h4>
                                <p>Lidera el plan de acción, presenta avances en reuniones, ejecuta muestreos, propone iniciativas y es el dueño de la métrica dentro de su equipo. Representa al equipo a nivel Publicaciones Mature.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="role-card fragment fade-up">
                            <div class="role-badge bg-purple">L2</div>
                            <div>
                                <h4>Referente Secundario (Soporte)</h4>
                                <p>Apoya al líder en análisis, recopila datos, realiza seguimientos complementarios y está preparado para asumir el liderazgo. Co-lidera iniciativas puntuales.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="card fragment fade-up" style="height: 100%;">
                            <div class="card-icon">🏗️</div>
                            <h3>Desarrollo de habilidades de liderazgo</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Cómo hacer <span class="highlight">presentaciones</span> de resultados</li>
                                <li>Cómo realizar <span class="highlight-blue">seguimientos</span> efectivos</li>
                                <li>Cómo hacer <span class="highlight-green">análisis de datos</span> y patrones</li>
                                <li>Cómo proponer <span class="highlight">planes de acción</span> con objetivos a corto, mediano y largo plazo</li>
                                <li>Cómo identificar <span class="highlight-blue">insights de valor</span></li>
                                <li>Cómo hacer <span class="highlight-green">muestreos</span> y detectar patrones</li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="insight-box" style="margin-top: 15px;">
                                <div class="insight-label">💰 Peso en el COMO</div>
                                <p>Proponer a líderes que este rol tenga <strong style="color: var(--meli-yellow);">peso en la evaluación del COMO</strong> de cada referente, para incentivar la dedicación y valorar el trabajo extra realizado.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <!-- SLIDE 5: NÚMEROS CLAVE -->
            <!-- ============================================== -->
            <section data-background-color="#0F0F1A">
                <div class="slide-header">
                    <div class="icon bg-cyan">📐</div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Dimensión del Programa</h2>
                        <span class="tag">Números Clave</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid cols-3" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
